0/100/100/100 coverage, docstrings, file-size, duplication, lint, TypeScript, ShellCheck, audit, Trivy, PM integrity, package smoke, and dry-run release all pass"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"hac-1sdd research step complete and plan approved"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"best-agent-home-assistant-cli"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"implement-bounded-coalesced-trigger-streaming"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Deliver the executable product behavior from hac-r2z9."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Agents can observe automation-level semantics without a broad unfiltered event stream."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Typed tested documented and live-proven WebSocket streaming behavior."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Official and live contracts are verified and the current transport is incompatible with coalesced arrays."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"hac-r2z9"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":98},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-websocket-streaming"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"2026.7.25"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"hac-1sdd","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"},{"id":"hac-3n6e","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"},{"id":"hac-ak9g","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"},{"id":"hac-r17v","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"},{"id":"hac-soop","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"},{"id":"hac-suj3","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"},{"id":"hac-sv5f","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"},{"id":"hac-vooo","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z"}]},{"op":"